hello and welcome to playstation grenade  since  season five began i've received a ton of  myths from you guys to chase  so i've listed the 20 most requested and  we're gonna fly through those today  so sit your butt down for 10 minutes  slap code adamarrow in the store for  99 more dad jokes in 2021 enjoy your  christmas  and let's bust some myths  let's start with something christmassy  the snowmen returned to fortnite for the  holiday period  many people wanted to know what happens  when you jump into the zero point  dressed as a snowman the myth goes if  you jump through here will somehow  become snomando kinda like what happened  when john d  and his banana went through a rift well  there's only one way to find out  let's do this  okay not a big outcome the snowman  simply breaks on entry and the player  continues through the nexus  as normal i thought the next best thing  to do would be to throw a snowman  on top of the zero point but something  happened that i wasn't expecting  check this the item never technically  lands and instead  goes into this rotating falling motion  it's cool to look at but sadly this  is another busted myth we have loads of  zero point myths to cover in this  episode and here's another christmas one  what happens when a present is thrown  into the zero  point right away i'm thinking it will  act the same as the snowman did sort of  rotating and falling away  well technically i was right it actually  hits the zero point  and bounces off but something very  strange happened if it bounces far  enough away from the orb it will  actually reappear  on top of the sphere for a split second  there you go  it's beautiful my discard and i spent  three hours trying different myths in  private matches  and we found one that's quite  interesting check this myth if a player  jumps through the zero point with a  clinger attached they will not be  harmed this has to be too good to be  true  right well we tested it we chose the  victim and attached explosives  and to our surprise it's true the zero  point negates the effect of the clinger  and removes it from the character they  don't take damage whilst inside the  spear  so if you ever get hit with a clinger  quickly builds all the way up to the  zero point  and jump through easy claps  [Music]  okay let's break from zero point myths  for a while here's the next one  the npcs and io troops have secret  unreleased gliders  well how could i resist this myth the  community found a rift fish  and overwhelmed mando allowing me to get  close enough to rift him away  i accidentally took half the lobby with  me but we certainly got the mandalorian  in the air  and after a little floating around we  saw his glider  and well it's only the default glider  rip the dream  we tested this on other npcs and i o  troops too and sadly  it looks like all npcs have the default  glider and nothing secretive at all  something interesting did happen during  these tests depending on where the  mandalorian  is when we rift him he will always go  back to the original crash site  he always goes back home i thought that  was a little cool touch  our next myth asks if we can cancel the  i o troops elevator from rising out of  the ground by simply landing on them  first  sounds like a plan batman and another  super easy one to test  we dived straight down in a squad game  and landed where we knew an elevator was  to our surprise that lift function still  works and bounces us all  into the air the only problem you've got  now is that you're trapped with no  weapons  around the aimbot io commandos  [Music]  another regular myth i'm asked is  regarding npcs for higher and if they  will use the zero point and regain  health  you'd think this would be easy to test  right simply hire an npc and then build  up to the zero point and jump in  well it can be a little bit more  difficult as the npcs  aren't the brightest in the world and  sometimes they'll jump off the ramp  sometimes they'll turn back round and  run back down again  in the end we made a bridge and shot it  out just underneath the npc to test this  and voila myth chased npcs can indeed  use a zero point  and are healed too which is useful i  guess  this next myth is brilliant who will win  in a fight between  mando and the io troops this is the  perfect amount of epic  right now in game mando can spawn a  little further west than the colosseum  and if you're lucky enough the io troops  can spawn at risky reels  getting them together is a pain in the  butt the plan was to aggro mando and  then move slightly out of sight so he  slowly followed behind me  i did this all the way until reaching  risky reels where i then aggro the i o  troops too  then my job was simple it was to stay  out of sight until they forgot about me  and started to engage each other and  then suddenly it happened  the io troops moved upstairs to have the  high ground advantage over mando  but then committed a rookie mistake by  leaving that high ground  and being caught in a doorway face to  face with the mandalorian and his best  car steel  armor mando is tough to beat monoa mono  and after a spirited performance io was  defeated  impressive work from the mandalorian so  if anyone asks who's stronger a unit of  io commandos or dinjarin  you now know  next myth back to the zero point if a  knocked player enters the zero point  they will be revived this sounds epic  like usual the discord fan came to help  me and here's what actually happens  the knocked player lands on the zero  point but to our surprise  nothing else they stay on top they can  crawl around to their heart's content  it's super strange isn't it well here's  something even stranger  if another person uses the zero point  whilst that knocked player is on top  this happens they begin to fall through  the sphere but the animation  doesn't complete they glitch around  within the sphere until they are spat  away from the orb  and smash into a thousand pieces we  appreciate your sacrifice  we also tried this whilst carrying a  knocked player and the same thing  happens the zero point does not open and  we are left standing on top  admiring the view so another busted myth  here's a perfectly strange myth a shark  can travel through the zero  point what you're thinking there's not a  chance is there  we know that cars and other vehicles  can't travel through the orb  yet we know items like the klinger  grenades can  so let's try this this myth was so tough  to do  firstly there's not that many sharks  around anymore and they don't seem to  like fall damage very much  but that's not the hard part the real  issue was getting the shark to the top  of the ramp  the shark naturally loses speed going up  the ramp so to boost this we reattach  the line  this works but the shark always bites  down the moment the fishing line  connects  and this led to so many times the ramp  breaking underneath us  but you don't want to see our struggles  do you you just want to cut to the end i  understand  as the shark reaches the zero point it  completely stops  it's mesmerized by the bright twinkly  lights what do you think it's thinking  i reckon it's saying dude i love  fortnite  to make it move again we actually have  to reattach the line one more time  this time as the shark moves into the  orb it automatically deflects around the  side  and falls to the ground the person being  carried though can still enter the zero  point  and for a short time the fishing line to  the shark will stay  in place but ultimately it'll snap this  shows us the shark is effectively  another vehicle  oh yeah in fact there is another myth  here what happens when a plane goes  through the zero point  nothing it hits it just like the other  vehicles and throws out the passengers  inside  and finally what happens when a junk  rift hits the zero point  i thought this was going to be another  epic gamer moment but  this actually happens the rift travels  through the orb without  any reaction and crushes everyone on the  ground underneath still looks pretty  cool though  i tried this with a porter fortress 2  and although the item bounced away from  the orb  it did build over the zero point again i  was impressed but then  realized this was due to the ramp i used  to climb up and by knocking down that  ramp  it also made the zero point fort fall  too  oh we need one more number 20 the dragon  breath  shotgun can light campfires did you know  i have no idea why this is a thing but  it is incendiary so it does make sense  so hopefully that's useful to someone  and now i'm thinking about trying this  with the sniper rifle version 2.  so there we have it 20 myths in super  quick time  thanks to everyone who watches these  videos and takes part in these meetups  on my discord  and a huge thank you to those kind  enough to use code adamaru in the store  on screen now are more legends who rock  my code thank you for choosing me  i'm adam from playstation grenade it's  been a pleasure have a good christmas  see you next time

